(F4 T6f WU1, nodal recovery of the tria6 [6-point nodal rule]. Two tria6
 of different area and stiffness share the edge 3-5-6. Professional
 02-08-2026: node = arithmetic mean of the adjacent elements' nodal values
 [corner node 3 sigxx -0.7216, GNU before the fix area-weighted -2.2407].
 Targets = Professional; tolerance 2e-4 of the family
 scale: the tria6 element itself differs ~1e-5 from the Professional
 [displacements too, BACKLOG], unrelated to the recovery.)
